/p></td><td><p>文档文件存储</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>LLM 编排</strong></p></td><td><p>LangChain / LlamaIndex</p></td><td><p>RAG Pipeline</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>部署</strong></p></td><td><p>Docker Compose → K8s</p></td><td><p>容器化部署</p></td></tr></table>\n\n","block_position":"0-7"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025737\"></a>\n# 3 多人协作规范制定","text_level":1,"page_idx":0,"id":"736e145a-07f4-4da0-a91a-c7f9b4988e7c","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025737","block_position":"0-8"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025738\"></a>\n## 3\\.1 代码规范","text_level":2,"page_idx":0,"id":"98a97e13-fb2d-4f00-8dfc-5dd8ce54f44c","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025738","block_position":"0-9"},{"id":"ff85833c-be00-4971-b544-f04cd0026af8","type":"text","text":"1. Python: Black \\+ Ruff \\+ mypy\n2. TypeScript: ESLint \\+ Prettier\n3. Pre\\-commit 自动检查\n4. Conventional Commits（feat:, fix:, docs:, refactor:, test:，chore: 等）","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-10"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025739\"></a>\n## 3\\.2 分支管理策略（GitHub Flow）","text_level":2,"page_idx":0,"id":"194b31c8-30de-4790-b1fd-d83ea0f2ac41","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025739","block_position":"0-11"},{"id":"c78b33a7-cdaa-4315-8c38-3dc87fae9663","type":"text","text":"1. 主分支：main — 始终处于可发布状态\n2. 开发分支：develop — 集成最新功能（如采用 Git Flow）\n3. 功能分支：feature/xxx — 从 develop 或 main 拉出，完成后合并回\n4. 修复分支：hotfix/xxx — 紧急修复，直接从 main 拉出，合并回 main 和 develop\n5. 发布分支：release/vx\\.y\\.z — 发布前准备（版本号、文档、测试）","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-12"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025740\"></a>\n# 4 项目文档网站搭建","text_level":1,"page_idx":0,"id":"8d76de5d-ff6e-4fac-ab96-09af4dca791a","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025740","block_position":"0-13"},{"id":"e961ec4d-eb66-412a-ac5b-c411bfaa0e7a","type":"text","text":"项目文档网站地址：[RAG\\-SGAI](https://orangesunrise.github.io/RAG-SGAI-Public/) ，https://orangesunrise\\.github\\.io/RAG\\-SGAI\\-Public/。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-14"},{"type":"image","img_path":"61047463586230790c50f6c80016e1f94dc74d0c9f98397b1e288e15eb924a71.jpg","page_idx":0,"id":"f3fd3195-cf22-4d1a-a9f0-7e2255282865","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-15"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025741\"></a>\n# 5 基于中文维基百科构建工业示例知识库","text_level":1,"page_idx":0,"id":"c2ac46fa-63fc-4e15-b27b-09ac4628c371","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025741","block_position":"0-16"},{"id":"07fd4dce-7790-43a6-82ea-7434c7998ce9","type":"text","text":"基于中文维基百科构建工业知识库，用于验证 S120 RAG 系统。用公开的、已处理好的结构化数据替代自己从零处理 PDF，让**文档处理与存储层**快速就位，使**检索与增强层**和**用户交互层**可以并行开发。后续再切换为真实西门子数据。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-17"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025742\"></a>\n## **5\\.1 为什么中文维基能模拟工业手册**","text_level":2,"page_idx":0,"id":"5e965f95-697a-4b4a-abed-a44ff157199a","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025742","block_position":"0-18"},{"id":"c5f02c16-11fc-4c5c-bbc3-10e1c07ba8c4","type":"text","text":"**中文维基的技术类条目和西门子手册在结构上高度相似：**","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-19"},{"type":"table","img_path":"","page_idx":0,"id":"f4e7ab1a-5465-46a7-9fd3-c6ef7f0dd0e8","color":{"line":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)","fill":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"table_body":"\n\n<table><tr><td><p><strong>中文维基结构</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>对应关系</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>西门子手册结构</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>标题（条目名）</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>≈</strong></p></td><td><p>参数编号（p1082）</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>概述段</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>≈</strong></p></td><td><p>描述文本</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>技术参数段</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>≈</strong></p></td><td><p>取值范围/默认值</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>相关条目链接</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>≈</strong></p></td><td><p>关联参数/功能图编号</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>分类标签</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>≈</strong></p></td><td><p>数据组归属/驱动对象</p></td></tr></table>\n\n","block_position":"0-20"},{"id":"350d4070-a2cf-468e-9e9c-0afb5b95fca0","type":"text","text":"用维基数据搭建的检索逻辑、分块策略、元数据过滤，后续切换到真实西门子数据时**不需要大改**——只需换数据源。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-21"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025743\"></a>\n## 5\\.2 示例数据库构建流水线","text_level":2,"page_idx":0,"id":"7aab0205-d121-47a4-b4ec-88b09c4323fe","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025743","block_position":"0-22"},{"type":"image","img_path":"11e8a0d30ca9ca16619b73151b7e920aa4c071cd963c664ebd247a6ee38b3f65.jpg","page_idx":0,"id":"8d55aae3-6705-48bb-beb5-1862cada52fd","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-23"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025744\"></a>\n## 5\\.3 示例数据库规模","text_level":2,"page_idx":0,"id":"07778ee8-ab01-4299-98ff-5186aa53aa77","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025744","block_position":"0-24"},{"type":"table","img_path":"","page_idx":0,"id":"6b3b3572-7b67-43b7-8e7f-5c22b4ed40aa","color":{"line":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)","fill":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"table_body":"\n\n<table><tr><td><p><strong>阶段</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>数量</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>原始中文条目</p></td><td><p>1,300,000</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>筛选后文档</p></td><td><p>~10,000</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Chunks</p></td><td><p>~40,000-60,000</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>向量维度</p></td><td><p>1024</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Qdrant 大小</p></td><td><p>~1-2 GB</p></td></tr></table>\n\n","block_position":"0-25"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025745\"></a>\n## 5\\.4 文件结构","text_level":2,"page_idx":0,"id":"c35a1120-e742-4dca-86be-27536255be8c","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025745","block_position":"0-26"},{"type":"image","img_path":"b1a2dc172b235a7508934810d2493dc63dbb7379c86efabe6dee60b81a5096c3.jpg","page_idx":0,"id":"83124138-7984-49b6-917c-d62f23797d8a","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-27"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025746\"></a>\n## 5\\.5 下载链接","text_level":2,"page_idx":0,"id":"c4c60e2b-a7d4-4f7b-86ed-430d5f02284d","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025746","block_position":"0-28"},{"id":"aa03b85e-2a8e-4659-b5b1-c45ab0001217","type":"text","text":"链接: https://pan\\.baidu\\.com/s/1L\\-lbO0zsbrNKuh\\-cm1f1tQ 提取码: cebd","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-29"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025747\"></a>\n# 6 制定规则驱动的结构化解析2000页参数章节方案","text_level":1,"page_idx":0,"id":"5ecb65f6-28fc-415d-937c-1b57f8c84321","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025747","block_position":"0-30"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025748\"></a>\n## 6\\.1 方案概述","text_level":2,"page_idx":0,"id":"7546d952-26f5-4559-83e4-0a7a0aafb500","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025748","block_position":"0-31"},{"id":"9e4bd24b-d700-458a-b131-64ec85316d74","type":"text","text":"S120参数章节属于典型的工业技术文档，具有参数数量多、页面结构固定、字段定义明确但版式复杂的特点。采用“Docling文档解析 \\+ Label Studio版式标注 \\+ Python结构化抽取 \\+ JSON参数库”的技术架构，可以充分利用现有文档规则，将PDF中的文字、版面和参数逻辑进行分离处理，既保证了参数提取的准确性和一致性，又避免了直接依赖大模型造成的成本高、结果不稳定和难以维护的问题。通过将提取后的参数转换为标准化JSON数据，可以进一步接入数据库和RAG知识库，实现参数快速检索、智能问答和后续设备文档数字化复用，形成从文档解析到智能应用的完整闭环。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-32"},{"id":"62ca3b25-f695-4880-bc6e-493d3453410d","type":"text","text":"本方案采用“文档解析—结构识别—数据转换—智能应用”的技术路线，核心目的是将S120手册中不可直接利用的PDF资料转换为标准化参数数据。通过文档解析工具提取原始内容，通过版式规则保证参数结构准确，通过结构化数据存储支撑后续查询和AI应用。相比直接使用大模型读取文档，该方案在处理近2000页工业参数手册时具有成本更低、结果更稳定、数据可复用性更强的优势，能够实现一次建设、多场景应用。","page_idx":0,"color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"","block_position":"0-33"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025749\"></a>\n## 6\\.2 技术路线","text_level":2,"page_idx":0,"id":"9217899c-cd58-4a08-ac8a-2bd133f1ed96","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025749","block_position":"0-34"},{"type":"image","img_path":"8271b669ac5db300e949c98fd3fedf9f92bd3eb27756a1bc5dea31953a41fede.jpg","page_idx":0,"id":"e78805c1-1ac2-4b6f-aecf-6515fe60812b","color":{"line":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)","fill":"rgba(89, 92, 220, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"block_position":"0-35"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025750\"></a>\n## 6\\.3 涉及技术与工具","text_level":2,"page_idx":0,"id":"36029674-0f09-432c-ba7f-0f8f8cfdf2c6","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025750","block_position":"0-36"},{"type":"table","img_path":"","page_idx":0,"id":"f2b9e8dd-4ff4-4cd5-848e-dd0f395628ea","color":{"line":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)","fill":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"table_body":"\n\n<table><tr><td><p><strong>技术环节</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>使用工具/技术</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>主要作用</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>输出结果</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>PDF文档解析</p></td><td><p>Docling</p></td><td><p>对S120 PDF进行解析，提取文本内容、页面结构、文字位置坐标（bbox）等信息，同时辅助识别表格和复杂版面关系</p></td><td><p>原始文本数据、页面布局信息、坐标信息</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>文档版式标注</p></td><td><p>Label Studio</p></td><td><p>对典型参数页面进行人工标注，定义参数区域、字段区域以及字段之间的位置关系，建立S120参数版式模板</p></td><td><p>参数页面结构模板</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>参数结构化抽取</p></td><td><p>Python解析程序</p></td><td><p>根据S120参数清单说明建立字段规则，结合Docling输出的文本和坐标信息，实现参数编号、名称、数据类型、范围、说明、枚举值等内容自动提取</p></td><td><p>标准化参数JSON数据</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>数据存储</p></td><td><p>JSON、数据库、Elasticsearch</p></td><td><p>将提取后的参数信息按照统一结构保存，支持后续查询、检索和数据管理</p></td><td><p>参数数据库</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>智能应用</p></td><td><p>向量数据库、RAG知识库</p></td><td><p>基于结构化参数数据构建智能检索和问答能力，实现参数快速查询、文档辅助分析</p></td><td><p>智能查询、AI问答系统</p></td></tr></table>\n\n","block_position":"0-37"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025751\"></a>\n## 6\\.4 **与大模型直接识别方案比较**","text_level":2,"page_idx":0,"id":"b6abcef1-7a04-4e0d-91bd-9c651122b7c6","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025751","block_position":"0-38"},{"type":"table","img_path":"","page_idx":0,"id":"01b46d42-765c-477e-8e53-5407298f0757","color":{"line":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)","fill":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"table_body":"\n\n<table><tr><td><p><strong>对比项</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>大模型直接识别PDF方案</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>结构化解析方案（推荐）</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>技术路线</strong></p></td><td><p>多模态大模型（视觉语言模型）直接理解PDF页面内容</p></td><td><p>Docling文档解析 + Label Studio版式标注 + Python参数抽取</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>处理流程</strong></p></td><td><p>PDF → 页面图片 → 大模型识别 → Markdown/JSON</p></td><td><p>PDF → 文档解析 → 版式规则 → 参数抽取 → JSON参数库</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>核心能力</strong></p></td><td><p>依靠模型理解页面内容和语义</p></td><td><p>依靠文档结构、规则和字段定义进行精准提取</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>优点</strong></p></td><td><p>1. 开发周期短；<br/>2. 少量页面识别效果好；<br/>3. 可快速生成摘要和说明</p></td><td><p>1. 一次建设，长期使用；<br/>2. 输出格式统一稳定；<br/>3. 支持1900页以上批量处理；<br/>4. 适合构建参数数据库和知识库</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>缺点</strong></p></td><td><p>1. 大规模处理成本较高；<br/>2. 输出格式存在不确定性；<br/>3. 难保证字段完整性；<br/>4. 难形成标准化数据资产</p></td><td><p>1. 前期需要建立参数模板；<br/>2. 需要少量人工标注和规则设计</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>数据复用能力</strong></p></td><td><p>较弱，结果主要用于阅读和总结</p></td><td><p>较强，可进入数据库、搜索系统和AI知识库</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>适用场景</strong></p></td><td><p>少量文档分析、内容总结</p></td><td><p>工业手册、设备参数文档、长期数据资产建设</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>推荐程度</strong></p></td><td><p>△ 辅助使用</p></td><td><p><strong>★★★★★ 推荐</strong></p></td></tr></table>\n\n","block_position":"0-39"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025752\"></a>\n## 6\\.5 **JSON与Markdown输出格式比较**","text_level":2,"page_idx":0,"id":"4d2d72f2-c85a-4981-8045-aece9a10752f","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025752","block_position":"0-40"},{"type":"table","img_path":"","page_idx":0,"id":"6e0e7610-8c17-459c-a2fe-bde2fb0ea4b0","color":{"line":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)","fill":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"table_body":"\n\n<table><tr><td><p><strong>对比项</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Markdown格式</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>JSON结构化格式（推荐作为基础数据）</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>定位</strong></p></td><td><p>面向人员阅读和展示</p></td><td><p><strong>面向系统处理和数据应用</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>示例</strong></p></td><td><p>参数说明文档、技术报告</p></td><td><p><strong>参数数据库记录</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>数据结构</strong></p></td><td><p>半结构化，格式依赖文本描述</p></td><td><p><strong>结构固定，字段明确</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>优点</strong></p></td><td><p>1. 阅读直观；<br/>2. 适合生成报告；<br/>3. 方便人工查看</p></td><td><p><strong>1. 字段固定；<br/>2. 易于数据库存储；<br/>3. 支持查询、统计；<br/>4. 支撑AI应用</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>缺点</strong></p></td><td><p>1. 不利于程序解析；<br/>2. 难以进行数据统计分析</p></td><td><p><strong>1. 初期需要设计数据模型；<br/>2. 人工阅读体验不如Markdown</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>应用场景</strong></p></td><td><p>技术文档展示、报告输出</p></td><td><p><strong>参数管理、搜索、RAG知识库</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>推荐方式</strong></p></td><td><p>由JSON自动生成Markdown</p></td><td><p><strong>作为核心数据源</strong></p></td></tr></table>\n\n","block_position":"0-41"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025753\"></a>\n## 6\\.6 **成本与实施可行性分析**","text_level":2,"page_idx":0,"id":"3727c92d-ce9b-4a3c-a72e-1b3f5a13e035","color":{"line":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)","fill":"rgba(13, 83, 222, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"anchor":"_Toc237025753","block_position":"0-42"},{"type":"table","img_path":"","page_idx":0,"id":"723592fe-f2cf-459b-8d0c-58288fe84277","color":{"line":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)","fill":"rgba(103, 194, 63, 1)"},"page_size":[595,842],"table_body":"\n\n<table><tr><td><p><strong>对比项</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>方案说明</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>成本及可行性</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>软件成本</strong></p></td><td><p>采用开源工具，包括Docling、Label Studio、Python生态工具</p></td><td><p>无需采购商业软件，软件投入低</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>硬件成本</strong></p></td><td><p>利用消费级笔记本完成PDF解析、标注和数据转换</p></td><td><p>相对服务器投入成本低</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>开发成本</strong></p></td><td><p>前期需要建立S120参数字段模板和解析规则</p></td><td><p>一次建设，可长期复用</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>数据处理成本</strong></p></td><td><p>通过规则化解析批量处理1900页参数</p></td><td><p>相比逐页人工整理，大幅降低人工成本</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>后续扩展成本</strong></p></td><td><p>新增类似设备手册时复用已有流程</p></td><td><p>较低，可推广到其他工业文档</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>实施风险</strong></p></td><td><p>主要风险为特殊页面格式差异</p></td><td><p>通过样本标注和规则优化控制</p></td></tr></table>\n\n","block_position":"0-43"},{"type":"title","text":"<a id=\"_Toc237025754\"></a